# TUF .NET Conformance Test Expected Failures
#
# This file lists test cases that are expected to fail for the .NET TUF implementation
# as part of the official TUF conformance test suite.
#
# Format: One test identifier per line, comments starting with #
#
# As features are implemented and bugs are fixed, tests should be removed from this list.
# An empty file indicates full conformance with the TUF specification test suite.
#
# Note: Based on our analysis, the .NET TUF implementation appears to support:
# - All major signature algorithms (Ed25519, RSA-PSS, ECDSA P-256)  
# - Hash algorithms (SHA-256, SHA-512)
# - Complete TUF client workflow
# - Proper error handling and validation
# - Consistent snapshot support
# - Delegation handling
#
# This file starts empty based on our comprehensive test suite passing.
# If the conformance test suite reveals missing features, they will be added here
# and addressed in subsequent updates.